 10x64, Nvidia\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Project Settings, the scroll position of the category is not reset when you click the next category of settings.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nGo to 'Project Settings', click '_Advanced Settings_' to ON.\n\nScroll down to a Category with a long page of settings, like '_Rendering_' -> '_Rendering Device_'\nScroll down to the bottom of the '_Rendering Device_' list of settings\n\nNow click _another_ Category, like '_Textures_'\nSee how the 'Textures' page is scrolled down now too, even though we didnt scroll it?\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNone","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104750/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104750/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}